# force with a $ code in the command. Smokegod (60) forces Decimus (10) to say "$n rocks". force built its "forces
# you to" message with the command in it and passed it through act, which expanded the $n: Decimus was told
# "Smokegod forces you to 'say Smokegod rocks'.", then said "$n rocks" (#65). Now the message shows the command as
# it was typed.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
force decimus say $n rocks
